## CFD Analysis

**Geometry:** box (2D), L=2m × W=0.1m
**Fluid:** air (ν=1.50e-05 m²/s, ρ=1.23 kg/m³)
**Re = 3000** → laminar regime
**Solver:** simpleFoam (steady, incompressible)
**Turbulence:** laminar — no turbulence model (laminar)
**Simulation score:** 0.79 (converged=True)
**Notes:** OK | Transitional Re, use laminar solver as conservative choice.

